[* 
process.rdn
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Ray Den
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Purpose:
Cross-platform process helpers over the native process module.

Loading behavior:
This module chooses the shared-library suffix from __sharedlib_ext and loads:
../nativelibs/process(.so|.dylib|.dll)

Exports:
- status : command -> exit status
- output : command -> stdout text
*]

"../nativelibs/process" __sharedlib_ext to_string swap pop append loadnative

status defun
    execStatus call
end

output defun
    execOutput call
end
